# Story 1.12 review P11 / D3: enforce LF line endings on committed perf
# baseline JSON files. `serde_json::to_string_pretty` emits `\n`; without this
# rule, Windows checkouts with `core.autocrlf=true` convert to `\r\n` and the
# next test run re-writes with `\n` — every Windows run dirties the file.
# Scoping kept narrow on purpose (no global `* text=auto`) to avoid changing
# behavior for the rest of the repo until a dedicated repo-hygiene story
# tackles end-of-line policy holistically.
tests/perf-baselines/*.json text eol=lf
